# Video wall on the 1080p (HDMI1) output — 2x2 grid.
# One RTSP URL per line, in row-major order:
#   1 2
#   3 4
#
# Exactly 4 non-comment lines are required.
#
# Get each URL from UniFi Protect: Camera -> Settings -> RTSP, enable the
# "Low" quality alias for each camera, then paste the URL Protect shows you.
#
# Example (replace with your real cameras):
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz1111
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz2222
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz3333
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/wxyz4444
